VALIDATION FLOW
================================================================================

User Fills Form
      ↓
Submit
      ↓
preventDefault()
      ↓
validateForm()
      ↓
newErrors
      ↓
+--------------------------+
|                          |
Errors                   Valid
|                          |
↓                          ↓
