================================================================================
IMPORTANT VALIDATION NOTES
================================================================================

The rules above are educational examples.

Real-world validation varies by application.

For example:

• Email validation can be more sophisticated

• Phone formats vary internationally

• Postal code formats differ by country

• Password policy should match the actual security requirements

• Username availability may require a server request


Most importantly:

CLIENT-SIDE VALIDATION
        ≠
SECURITY BOUNDARY


Server/API validation is still necessary for data sent to a backend.


