================================================================================
CRITICAL MULTI-FORM POINTS
================================================================================

STATE:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

const [formData, setFormData] =
  useState(INITIAL_FORM)


GENERIC TEXT-LIKE HANDLER:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

const handleChange = (
  event
) => {

  const {
    name,
    value
  } = event.target


  setFormData(previous => ({

    ...previous,

    value

  }))
}


MIXED-TYPE HANDLER:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

const {
  name,
  value,
  type,
  checked
} = event.target


const nextValue =
  type === 'checkbox'
    ? checked
    : value


setFormData(previous => ({

  ...previous,

  nextValue

}))


================================================================================
FLAT STATE
================================================================================

{
  firstName: '',
  lastName: '',
  email: '',
  city: ''
}


Useful when:

• Form structure is straightforward

• A generic handler is desirable


================================================================================
NESTED STATE
================================================================================

{
  personal: {
    firstName: '',
    lastName: ''
  },

  address: {
    city: '',
    state: ''
  }
}


Useful when:

• Domain grouping is meaningful

• Submission data is naturally nested


Trade-off:

Nested updates require copying each modified level.


================================================================================
FORM SUBMISSION
================================================================================

const handleSubmit = (
  event
) => {

  event.preventDefault()


  const errors =
    validateForm()


  if (
    Object.keys(
      errors
    ).length > 0
  ) {

    setErrors(errors)

    return
  }


  // Process safe submission payload
}


================================================================================
FORM RESET
================================================================================

const handleReset = () => {

  setFormData(
    INITIAL_FORM
  )

  setErrors({})

  setSubmitted(false)
}


