QUICK REVISION TABLE
================================================================================

+------------------------+----------------------------------------------+
| CONCEPT                | REMEMBER                                     |
+------------------------+----------------------------------------------+
| INITIAL_FORM           | Reusable reset/initial structure             |
| formData               | Current controlled values                    |
| errors                 | Validation messages                          |
| name                   | Maps input to state property                 |
| value                  | Text-like control value                      |
| checked                | Checkbox state                               |
| [name]                 | Computed property                            |
| Spread                 | Preserves other properties                   |
| Functional Update      | Uses latest previous state                   |
| fieldset               | Groups related controls                      |
| legend                 | Names grouped controls                       |
| preventDefault         | Cancels native submit action                 |
| Nested State           | Requires nested immutable copying            |
| Dynamic Fields         | Often modeled as arrays                      |
| Conditional Fields     | May require stale-value policy               |
+------------------------+----------------------------------------------+


================================================================================
ONE-LINE MEMORY FORMULAS
================================================================================

MULTIPLE FIELDS:

Many Inputs
    ↓
One State Object
    ↓
One Handler


GENERIC UPDATE:

name
 +
value
   ↓
value


CHECKBOX:

checked
   ↓
Boolean State


IMMUTABLE OBJECT UPDATE:

Previous State
     ↓
Spread Existing Properties
     ↓
Override Changed Property
     ↓
Next State


NESTED UPDATE:

Previous Parent
     ↓
Copy Parent
     ↓
Copy Nested Object
     ↓
Update Nested Property


VALIDATION:

formData
   ↓
validateForm()
   ↓
errors
   ↓
Render Messages


RESET:

INITIAL_FORM
     ↓
setFormData()
     ↓
Initial Controlled Values


MOST IMPORTANT RULE:

THE INPUT'S name ATTRIBUTE SHOULD IDENTIFY
THE FORM-DATA PROPERTY THAT THE GENERIC HANDLER UPDATES.


